id: inherited-life-mastered-reincarnated
name: Mastered Reincarnated
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  You've completely mastered the powers you inherited from your past self, making them truly your own.
text: >
  Mastered Reincarnated: You've completely mastered the powers you inherited from your past self, making them truly your own.
  (1)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Transformation, regain access to the Racial Trait that you replaced with the Factor Trait from the Reincarnated Factor.
  (2)-[Passive]: The Attribute Modifier Bonus of this Transformation is +2 in the three Attributes with the highest Attribute Scores among your Past Life's Attributes.
  (3)-[Passive]: While you are benefiting from the 5th effect of the Lingering Power Factor Trait, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(bT).
  (4)-[Passive]: The 5th effect of the Lingering Power Factor Trait loses its [1/Encounter] Keyword and gains the [1/Round, 2/Encounter] Keyword.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, you may use a Signature Technique possessed by your Past Life.

---

# Written, not applied yet: its effects arrive with its stage (the plan).
